      "y": 602.4999995873022,
      "width": 758.1395263671875,
      "height": 400,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2m",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1775785914,
      "version": 1477,
      "versionNonce": 465332730,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795103694019,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Summary\n\nOne block of 4 threads fills 4 spots of C.\nEach spot needs a row of A and column of B: 4 terms.\n\nWith real sizes, the block's slice of shared memory is too small for whole rows\nand columns, so it only holds on piece of each. That is why the sum\nis done in 2 rounds (phases), 2 terms per round.\n\nRound 1: copy A1 and B1 into shared memory + barrier.\nEvery thread multiplies and adds its first 2 terms + barrier.\n\nRound 2: copy A2 and B2 into the same slots + barrier.\nEvery thread adds its last 2 terms to what it already has.\n\nThen each thread writes its finished total to its spot of C.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Summary\n\nOne block of 4 threads fills 4 spots of C.\nEach spot needs a row of A and column of B: 4 terms.\n\nWith real sizes, the block's slice of shared memory is too small for whole rows\nand columns, so it only holds on piece of each. That is why the sum\nis done in 2 rounds (phases), 2 terms per round.\n\nRound 1: copy A1 and B1 into shared memory + barrier.\nEvery thread multiplies and adds its first 2 terms + barrier.\n\nRound 2: copy A2 and B2 into the same slots + barrier.\nEvery thread adds its last 2 terms to what it already has.\n\nThen each thread writes its finished total to its spot of C.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
